{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-cat-model.md","title":"本书的 FhoDTT 结构","display":"df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 本书的 FhoDTT 结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","Categorical FHoDTT model"],"display":"df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 本书的 FhoDTT 结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","[[16-df-fibred-reflection]]","[[16-df-generic-object]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]","[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]"],"source":"Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2, pp. 694–695 (PDF 714–715)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</span><span>Categorical FHoDTT model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 本书的 FhoDTT 结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17bdb224f449da45\" href=\"?note=17bdb224f449da45\" title=\"16-df-fibred-reflection\">16-df-fibred-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"241e7e90b85de13e\" href=\"?note=241e7e90b85de13e\" title=\"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure\">16-df-split-fhodtt-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2, pp. 694–695 (PDF 714–715)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>候选记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D,p,q,\\chi,L,X,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\Omega,G)\">\\(M=(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D,p,q,\\chi,L,X,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\Omega,G)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\epsilon\">\\(\\eta,\\epsilon\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"17bdb224f449da45\" href=\"?note=17bdb224f449da45\" title=\"16-df-fibred-reflection\">16-df-fibred-reflection</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 为基终对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Omega\\}=\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi\\Omega)\">\\(\\{\\Omega\\}=\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi\\Omega)\\)</span>；此原子记录普通泛对象版本，分裂版本须以指定分裂及分裂泛对象替换相应数据。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredReflection}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredReflection}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"17bdb224f449da45\" href=\"?note=17bdb224f449da45\" title=\"16-df-fibred-reflection\">16-df-fibred-reflection</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 另外表示 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"241e7e90b85de13e\" href=\"?note=241e7e90b85de13e\" title=\"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure\">16-df-split-fhodtt-structure</a> 的候选严格记录，使用该页各个带型属操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\\)</span> 在下节定义，不与普通记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 混用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf K_S,\\mathsf A^s_S,\\mathsf V_S,\\mathsf S_S\">\\(\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf K_S,\\mathsf A^s_S,\\mathsf V_S,\\mathsf S_S\\)</span> 为本页对 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a> 的带注释有限树构造的部分函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)\">\\(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)\\)</span> 的值是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,A,a)\">\\((s,A,a)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma,A)\">\\(a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma,A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v_S\">\\(\\mathsf v_S\\)</span> 只取第三分量。每个递归分支只在全部子值已定义、其 sort 和类型分量等于对应操作所需的参数、且所用函数具有该输入时定义；其余输入不定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span> 表示有定义。定义域条件只检查语义集合/函数的型属，不检查待证的句法可推导性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D\">\\(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D\\)</span> 简写第一个参数为扩张语境、第二个参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的函数应用；类似的分号应用遵循同一约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_3\\)</span> 是三元组第三投影，空投影复合为恒等。类型注释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,x.D,z.E\">\\(C,x.D,z.E\\)</span> 参与递归。绑定变量先按语法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 约定取新鲜，语义语境只依声明顺序，不依变量名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>相互递归的良基度量使用表达式树节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|e|\">\\(|e|\\)</span> 与语境注释总大小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(\\Gamma)=\\sum_i|C_i|\">\\(\\ell(\\Gamma)=\\sum_i|C_i|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\ell(\\Gamma),2)\">\\((\\ell(\\Gamma),2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,e)\">\\(\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,e)\\)</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\ell(\\Gamma)+|e|,1)\">\\((\\ell(\\Gamma)+|e|,1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,e)\">\\(\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,e)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)\">\\(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)\\)</span> 的秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\ell(\\Gamma)+|e|,0)\">\\((\\ell(\\Gamma)+|e|,0)\\)</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 的字典序递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v_S\">\\(\\mathsf v_S\\)</span> 先展开为第三投影的缩写；递归调用的秩严格降低。替换解释再按替换元组长度递归调用已经构造的这些函数。形成 sort 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 的分支由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_S\">\\(\\mathsf K_S\\)</span> 给出，形成 sort 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 时先求该表达式作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 的项，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{El}\">\\(\\operatorname{El}\\)</span>。类型码节点通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}\">\\(\\operatorname{code}\\)</span> 解释。因此两个 sort 的形成与项判断没有未声明的第三种含义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\land q=pX\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FibredReflection}(L,X;p,q,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal E_1\\land G\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{\\Omega\\}}\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_q(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}(M)\\land\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(q,\\chi X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\land q=pX\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FibredReflection}(L,X;p,q,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal E_1\\land G\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{\\Omega\\}}\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_q(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}(M)\\land\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(q,\\chi X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{SplitFHo}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{SplitFHo}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_S(())&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf1,\\\\\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\triangleright_s\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_S(\\Gamma,C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,C)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{El}_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)}(c)\n\\quad\\bigl(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,C)\n=(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},c)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type})&amp;\\coloneqq\\Omega_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,1_{\\mathsf{Kind}})&amp;\\coloneqq1^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:C).D)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Kind}}\n\\bigl(\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D)\\bigr)\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_S(())&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf1,\\\\\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\triangleright_s\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_S(\\Gamma,C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,C)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{El}_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)}(c)\n\\quad\\bigl(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,C)\n=(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},c)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type})&amp;\\coloneqq\\Omega_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,1_{\\mathsf{Kind}})&amp;\\coloneqq1^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:C).D)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Kind}}\n\\bigl(\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D)\\bigr)\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\qquad\nA\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\qquad\nB\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^t_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,1_{\\mathsf{Type}})\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_I,\\operatorname{code}_I(1_I^{\\mathsf{Type}})),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Type}}(x:C).D)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_I,\n\\operatorname{code}_I(\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Type}}(A,B)))\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\},\\ t=\\mathsf{Type}),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,()_s)&amp;\\coloneqq(s,1_I^s,*_I^s),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))\n&amp;\\coloneqq(t,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B),\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);b))),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(f,a))\n&amp;\\coloneqq(t,B[\\overline{\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a)}],\n\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,f),\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a))),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))\n&amp;\\coloneqq(t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a),\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,b))),\\\\\n\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_3(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\qquad\nA\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\qquad\nB\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^t_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,1_{\\mathsf{Type}})\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_I,\\operatorname{code}_I(1_I^{\\mathsf{Type}})),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Type}}(x:C).D)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_I,\n\\operatorname{code}_I(\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Type}}(A,B)))\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\},\\ t=\\mathsf{Type}),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,()_s)&amp;\\coloneqq(s,1_I^s,*_I^s),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))\n&amp;\\coloneqq(t,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B),\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);b))),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(f,a))\n&amp;\\coloneqq(t,B[\\overline{\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a)}],\n\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,f),\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a))),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))\n&amp;\\coloneqq(t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a),\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,b))),\\\\\n\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_3(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{&lt;i}&amp;\\coloneqq((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^{i-1},\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{\\le i}\\coloneqq((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^{i},\\qquad\nA_i\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^{s_i}_S(\\Gamma_{&lt;i},C_i),\\\\\np_i&amp;\\coloneqq p^{s_i}_{A_i}:\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma_{\\le i})\\to\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma_{&lt;i}),\\qquad\nr_i\\coloneqq p_{i+1}\\cdots p_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,x_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n(s_i,A_i[p_i r_i],q^{s_i}_{A_i}[r_i])\n\\quad\\bigl(\\Gamma=((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^n\\bigr),\\\\\nJ&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\\qquad\nE&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^u_S(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E),\\\\\nd&#39;&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C),(y,t,D);d),\\qquad\np&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,p),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left(u,E&#39;[\\bar p&#39;],\\\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E&#39;}^{s,t,u}(d&#39;)[\\bar p&#39;]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{&lt;i}&amp;\\coloneqq((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^{i-1},\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{\\le i}\\coloneqq((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^{i},\\qquad\nA_i\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^{s_i}_S(\\Gamma_{&lt;i},C_i),\\\\\np_i&amp;\\coloneqq p^{s_i}_{A_i}:\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma_{\\le i})\\to\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma_{&lt;i}),\\qquad\nr_i\\coloneqq p_{i+1}\\cdots p_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,x_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n(s_i,A_i[p_i r_i],q^{s_i}_{A_i}[r_i])\n\\quad\\bigl(\\Gamma=((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^n\\bigr),\\\\\nJ&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\\qquad\nE&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^u_S(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E),\\\\\nd&#39;&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C),(y,t,D);d),\\qquad\np&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,p),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left(u,E&#39;[\\bar p&#39;],\\\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E&#39;}^{s,t,u}(d&#39;)[\\bar p&#39;]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf S_S(():\\Delta\\Rightarrow())&amp;\\coloneqq!_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Delta)},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_S((\\sigma,a):\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma,(x,s,C))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf S_S(\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma),\\mathsf v_S(\\Delta,a)\\rangle_{\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C)},\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma⟧_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n⟦ C⟧^s_{S,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash e:C⟧_S\n&amp;\\coloneqq a\n\\quad\\bigl(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)=(s,\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),a)\\bigr),\\\\\n⟦\\sigma⟧_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_S(\\sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf S_S(():\\Delta\\Rightarrow())&amp;\\coloneqq!_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Delta)},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_S((\\sigma,a):\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma,(x,s,C))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf S_S(\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma),\\mathsf v_S(\\Delta,a)\\rangle_{\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C)},\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma⟧_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n⟦ C⟧^s_{S,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash e:C⟧_S\n&amp;\\coloneqq a\n\\quad\\bigl(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)=(s,\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),a)\\bigr),\\\\\n⟦\\sigma⟧_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_S(\\sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的纤维解释 kinds，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 的纤维解释 types；二者都在同一个语境范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 上。</li>\n<li>“full higher order”不是再叠加一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的命题预序纤维化；本书核心是同底的反射、类型分类 kind，以及类型和 kind 的依赖关系。</li>\n<li>普通结构保持原书的范畴接口；严格语境族版本另外以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\\)</span> 明确命名。后续可靠性、完备性对该严格版本量化，其句法商模型与逐规则证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0fc14f4a062b4abf\" href=\"?note=0fc14f4a062b4abf\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-term-model\">16-df-fhodtt-term-model</a>。不把普通泛对象的同构分类唯一性误作分裂泛对象的严格对象分类。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2, pp. 694–695 (PDF 714–715)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"17bdb224f449da45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-generic-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure","status":"resolved","id":"241e7e90b85de13e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"17bdb224f449da45","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$，$L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$，$X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$；$\\eta,\\epsilon$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-reflection]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"17bdb224f449da45","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredReflection}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-reflection]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-generic-object]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure","status":"resolved","id":"241e7e90b85de13e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"以下 $S$ 另外表示 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 的候选严格记录，使用该页各个带型属操作；$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 在下节定义，不与普通记录 $M$ 混用。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf K_S,\\mathsf A^s_S,\\mathsf V_S,\\mathsf S_S$ 为本页对 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]] 的带注释有限树构造的部分函数。$\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)$ 的值是三元组 $(s,A,a)$，其中 $A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma)$、$a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma,A)$；$\\mathsf v_S$ 只取第三分量。每个递归分支只在全部子值已定义、其 sort 和类型分量等于对应操作所需的参数、且所用函数具有该输入时定义；其余输入不定义。$\\downarrow$ 表示有定义。定义域条件只检查语义集合/函数的型属，不检查待证的句法可推导性。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"普通结构保持原书的范畴接口；严格语境族版本另外以 $\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 明确命名。后续可靠性、完备性对该严格版本量化，其句法商模型与逐规则证明见 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]。不把普通泛对象的同构分类唯一性误作分裂泛对象的严格对象分类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D,p,q,\\chi,L,X,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\Omega,G)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta,\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\Omega\\}=\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredReflection}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf K_S,\\mathsf A^s_S,\\mathsf V_S,\\mathsf S_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)","display":false},{"tex":"(s,A,a)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf v_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_3","display":false},{"tex":"C,x.D,z.E","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"|e|","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(\\Gamma)=\\sum_i|C_i|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\ell(\\Gamma),2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,e)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\ell(\\Gamma)+|e|,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\ell(\\Gamma)+|e|,0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf v_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf K_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{El}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\land q=pX\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{FibredReflection}(L,X;p,q,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal E_1\\land G\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{\\Omega\\}}\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_q(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{WeakFHoDTTModel}(M)\\land\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(q,\\chi X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{SplitFHo}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C_S(())&\\coloneqq\\mathbf1,\\\\\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C))&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\triangleright_s\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_S(\\Gamma,C)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,C)&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{El}_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)}(c)\n\\quad\\bigl(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,C)\n=(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},c)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type})&\\coloneqq\\Omega_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,1_{\\mathsf{Kind}})&\\coloneqq1^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:C).D)\n&\\coloneqq\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Kind}}\n\\bigl(\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\n\\mathsf K_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D)\\bigr)\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI&\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\qquad\nA\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\qquad\nB\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^t_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,1_{\\mathsf{Type}})\n&\\coloneqq(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_I,\\operatorname{code}_I(1_I^{\\mathsf{Type}})),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Type}}(x:C).D)\n&\\coloneqq(\\mathsf{Kind},\\Omega_I,\n\\operatorname{code}_I(\\mathcal B^{s,\\mathsf{Type}}(A,B)))\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\},\\ t=\\mathsf{Type}),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,()_s)&\\coloneqq(s,1_I^s,*_I^s),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))\n&\\coloneqq(t,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B),\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);b))),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(f,a))\n&\\coloneqq(t,B[\\overline{\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a)}],\n\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,f),\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a))),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))\n&\\coloneqq(t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,a),\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,b))),\\\\\n\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,e)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_3(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{<i}&\\coloneqq((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^{i-1},\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{\\le i}\\coloneqq((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^{i},\\qquad\nA_i\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^{s_i}_S(\\Gamma_{<i},C_i),\\\\\np_i&\\coloneqq p^{s_i}_{A_i}:\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma_{\\le i})\\to\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma_{<i}),\\qquad\nr_i\\coloneqq p_{i+1}\\cdots p_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,x_i)&\\coloneqq\n(s_i,A_i[p_i r_i],q^{s_i}_{A_i}[r_i])\n\\quad\\bigl(\\Gamma=((x_j,s_j,C_j))_{j=1}^n\\bigr),\\\\\nJ&\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\\qquad\nE'\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^u_S(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E),\\\\\nd'&\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,(x,s,C),(y,t,D);d),\\qquad\np'\\coloneqq\\mathsf v_S(\\Gamma,p),\\\\\n\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))\n&\\coloneqq\n\\left(u,E'[\\bar p'],\\\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E'}^{s,t,u}(d')[\\bar p']\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf S_S(():\\Delta\\Rightarrow())&\\coloneqq!_{\\mathsf C_S(\\Delta)},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_S((\\sigma,a):\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma,(x,s,C))\n&\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf S_S(\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma),\\mathsf v_S(\\Delta,a)\\rangle_{\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C)},\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma⟧_S&\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n⟦ C⟧^s_{S,\\Gamma}\\coloneqq\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash e:C⟧_S\n&\\coloneqq a\n\\quad\\bigl(\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)=(s,\\mathsf A^s_S(\\Gamma,C),a)\\bigr),\\\\\n⟦\\sigma⟧_S&\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_S(\\sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}","display":false}],"bytes":8182,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e0334547580ab00","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$ 为 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 的结构记录，$\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}$ 是其中定义的普通版本谓词。"},{"id":"4bbf6d604961cbb2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"范畴、集合族、重索引和各项操作的目标格式采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]；$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 和递归解释采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]。下式不是把句法模型性放进前提，而是先给全部分量再断言它满足结构公理。"},{"id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 构造其句法商模型；[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"},{"id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)$ 及其递归解释采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]；$S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 的严格候选记录，$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)$ 及 $\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf A^s_S,\\mathsf V_S,⟦-⟧_S$ 均取该页的完整结构与部分递归函数。$\\mathcal C_S$ 为记录中的底范畴，$\\operatorname{Ty}^S_s,\\operatorname{Tm}^S_s$ 为记录中的集合族；$\\downarrow$ 表示部分值已定义。"}],"outgoing":["3015a5a145e2e498","17bdb224f449da45","f600e95377e8cbf9","c9801f31ec8ac53f","241e7e90b85de13e","3930e297a315728a","ca2d757f82798122","0fc14f4a062b4abf"]}